<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30456" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκυκλ-έομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>roll</i> or
				<i>rotate in</i> the sockets, of the joints, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>de Arte</u>
				10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in com.
			sense, <i>to be cooped up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ οἶδ᾽ ὅπῃ ἐγκεκύκλησαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					699
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>surround</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>TG</u>
				5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἀμφὶ πλουσίαν τράπεζαν -
					κυκλουμένους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.50d
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
